<title>USA: Mesquite ISD, Texas, won by Smith Barney.</title>
<headline>Mesquite ISD, Texas, won by Smith Barney.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney said it won $10 million of Mesquite ISD, Texas, school building bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.229 percent.</p>
